{
  "repo": "URTC-COMMON",
  "ecosystem": "urtc",
  "tagline": "The CAN protocol of the tool head written once as data, with its generators, vectors and shared Python parts.",
  "description": "URTC-COMMON holds the specification of the CAN protocol (spec/can_protocol.json), generators that write the C header, the TypeScript module and the Python module, conformance vectors, the Python package with the SLCAN codec, the transports, a virtual board and the signed self-update flow, and vendor_copy.py, which puts checked copies into the other repositories. Everything is tested on a computer; nothing has been run against a real board or a CAN adapter.",
  "columns": [
    "WHO USES IT",
    "THIS REPOSITORY",
    "WHAT IT TOUCHES"
  ],
